# Force LF for all text files, regardless of the committer's or CI
# runner's platform/autocrlf setting. Without this, a Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true silently rewrites working-tree files to CRLF,
# which then diverges from the LF bytes actually stored in the commit -
# and scoring/PROTECTED_MANIFEST.json is a sha256 of committed bytes, not
# of whatever a given machine's checkout happens to produce. This file is
# what makes hashing deterministic across platforms.
* text=lf
